      "cr": 4,
      "spellLevel": 0,
      "ideal": "A guest who pays and does not hatch anything is a good guest.",
      "bond": "His inn, his regulars, and the continued survival of Table Seven.",
      "flaw": "He records grudges more accurately than reservations."
